{"title":"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each day Maria must work <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours.  This does not include the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes she takes for lunch.  If she begins working at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/4/bb49b56fb8a904681902dcaaf6ecb38fee372e51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{7:25 A.M.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" /> and takes her lunch break at noon, then her working day will end at\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/d/86d20c95841397e2bb00be54d63d83305b805ae8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\text{3:40 P.M.} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\text{3:55 P.M.} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\text{4:10 P.M.} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\text{4:25 P.M.} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\text{4:40 P.M.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"631\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>8 hours from 7:25 AM is 15:25 or 3:25 PM. 45 minutes from 25 minutes is 10 minutes after the hour, so her working day ends at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/1/3c18c16d1694013cd3e7dbcc0e476679f761dc1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(C)}\\ \\text{4:10 P.M.}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"111\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME\" title=\"1994 AJHSME\">1994 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1994\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Pro